# News snapshot: the exact RSS article set a run used. Regenerated on every
# live fetch, so committing it would add a daily diff of thousands of
# articles for no benefit. Its SHA-256 is recorded in experiment_manifest.json
# instead, which is what reproducibility actually needs.
data_input/news_snapshot.json

